# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production mode) only — `npm run dev`
# / `vite preview` still fall back to src/lib/api.ts's http://localhost:8100
# default. See DEPLOY-LEDGER.md.
#
# Same-origin, relative path: the browser requests
# https://ledger.circlejerks.live/api/... and Caddy's `handle_path /api/*`
# block proxies it to ledger-api:8100 inside the internal network. Because
# the browser never sees a different origin, there is zero CORS
# configuration anywhere — the same pattern circlejerks.live already uses
# for frontend/src/lib/api.ts's API_BASE = "/api".
VITE_API_BASE=/api

# The live map's positions poll: same-origin, relative path, proxied by
# Caddy's `handle_path /live/*` block straight to the main circlejerks API's
# already-public /positions endpoint. Same zero-CORS reasoning as
# VITE_API_BASE above.
VITE_LIVE_BASE=/live
